Restores a verified snapshot, retaining the previous database and leaving all app containers stopped. Recover its recorded image afterward

Usage: leptoskit infra restore [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --snapshot <SNAPSHOT>  [default: latest]
      --yes                  
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
